{"unit_id":"guooo1380__dsh-team-panel#card-zh","repo":"guooo1380/dsh-team-panel","commit":"3f237619d1c48f70a2c27f34a5712f444e38c12f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-team-panel 是一款面向 DSH Desktop 和 Web 的团队用量面板。它监听会话用量事件，只记录用户选定项目及其子目录的 Token 消耗，并把汇总数据同步到自建团队服务器。面板固定显示在侧栏，可查看成员、项目、Token 数、估算费用和 DeepSeek 峰谷时段；用户还能选择或停止监测项目、清零账本、加入或退出团队并手动同步。适合需要按项目了解多人 DSH 使用量的开发团队。需 Node.js 20 以上、团队服务器地址和邀请码；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:460-489","lib/index.js:535-570","lib/index.js:724-768","lib/panel.js:379-393"]}
{"unit_id":"guooo1380__dsh-team-panel#card-en","repo":"guooo1380/dsh-team-panel","commit":"3f237619d1c48f70a2c27f34a5712f444e38c12f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-team-panel tracks token use for one DSH project and shares team totals through a self hosted server. Its sidebar shows member usage, costs, and DeepSeek peak periods. Users can change projects, reset totals, and sync. Requires Node.js 20+, server address, and invite code; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:460-489","lib/index.js:535-570","lib/index.js:724-768","lib/panel.js:379-393"]}
