{"unit_id":"guooo1380__dsh-team-panel#feature-1","repo":"guooo1380/dsh-team-panel","commit":"3f237619d1c48f70a2c27f34a5712f444e38c12f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-team-panel 的功能「按项目统计」：选择工作区后，插件仅累计该目录及子目录会话的输入、缓存和输出 Token，并估算费用。未选项目或会话不属于所选目录时不会计入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:442-489"]}
{"unit_id":"guooo1380__dsh-team-panel#feature-2","repo":"guooo1380/dsh-team-panel","commit":"3f237619d1c48f70a2c27f34a5712f444e38c12f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-team-panel 的功能「团队用量同步」：加入团队后，插件将所选项目、成员信息和用量账本发往配置的团队服务器，并拉取团队快照供面板展示；后台每 20 秒同步一次。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:350-432","lib/index.js:724-768","lib/index.js:846-853"]}
{"unit_id":"guooo1380__dsh-team-panel#feature-3","repo":"guooo1380/dsh-team-panel","commit":"3f237619d1c48f70a2c27f34a5712f444e38c12f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-team-panel 的功能「侧栏项目面板」：插件把面板脚本注入 DSH Web 界面，用户可展开查看团队成员和项目用量，并选择或停止项目监测、清空当前项目账本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:829-844","lib/panel.js:379-393","lib/panel.js:802-843"]}
{"unit_id":"guooo1380__dsh-team-panel#feature-4","repo":"guooo1380/dsh-team-panel","commit":"3f237619d1c48f70a2c27f34a5712f444e38c12f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-team-panel 的功能「峰谷时段提示」：面板显示当前 DeepSeek 峰或谷时段及下一次切换倒计时；判定依据北京时间工作日时段和代码内列出的节假日。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/peak.mjs:56-121","lib/panel.js:412-446"]}
{"unit_id":"guooo1380__dsh-team-panel#caveat-1","repo":"guooo1380/dsh-team-panel","commit":"3f237619d1c48f70a2c27f34a5712f444e38c12f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-team-panel 使用前须知：加入团队后，成员名、机器名、项目名与路径及用量账本会发送到自行配置的团队服务器；本机状态文件还保存成员令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:101-115","lib/index.js:350-432","lib/index.js:724-768"]}
